    "m_Content": "Sine wave based on X global position (red channel). \n\nThis will displace the vertices based on their position on the X axis.\n\nWe can control the: \n-Speed (time multiplier), \n-Frequency (Domain/input multiplier),\n-Amplitude (Final sine result/output multiplier)",
